The annual membership meeting heard telephonic greetings from California Angels general manager Fred Haney, vice
president Marvin Milkes and farm director Roland Heman.
Each Angel representative promised that a strong team would be fielded for the coming season.

Officers elected for the year are John Phelan, president; Harty Elliott, Andy Cohen, Jack Ni-
land and Chick Arnold, vice presidents; Bob Haynsworth secretary and assistant treasurer and Dorr Miller treasurer and assis-
tant secretary.

